rences/**/*.md` for dispatch steps (lines containing `Agent(` calls, `subagent_type=`, `@dh:` agent references in delegation prompts, `Skill(skill: \\\"<sub-skill>\\\"` handoffs, or `TeamCreate` calls)\\n- Inline the dispatch-discipline reminder at each such step\\n- Audit every agent prompt under `plugins/development-harness/agents/**.md` for dispatch instructions and apply the same fix\\n- Decide: should the CLAUDE.md rule be removed after the skills are updated, or kept as a safety net? This is an editorial decision to make during the work.\\n- Add a linter or check that catches missing inline discipline at future dispatch steps (a grep-based test in `plugins/development-harness/tests/` that fails CI when a dispatch step lacks the reminder)\\n\\nOut of scope:\\n\\n- Changing the dispatch pattern itself \u2014 task-worker discipline is not being revisited, only its documentation location\\n- Changing the `agent:` field semantics in SAM task YAML\\n- Changes to skills outside the `development-harness` plugin\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"ddd569c8cd0d10b364bf61cd1fa52d131139c13fecb3ec0aa90f6c7160e889f2\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPtdQBg\"}"}